  dct:description "Is the tenderer aware of breaches of provisions on working conditions as stated in national law, the relevant notice or procurement documents or Article 18 (2) of Directive 2014/24/EU."@en .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/9048dd17-3750-47f5-957c-7c69f0b55fbc-01/ExclusionGround$_ContractNotice1_TenderingTerms1_TendererQualificationRequest1_SpecificTendererRequirement9>
